			title: "&6&lWelcome to Tech, Scales & Rockets!",
			description: [
				"&7Your journey begins with empty hands in a harsh, uncompromising world.",
				"",
				"&fIn &6Tech, Scales & Rockets&f, technology, bio-alchemy, astral magic, and intergalactic travel are tightly interwoven. You cannot skip any boss or phase—every machine requires slaying ancient evil, and every titan requires stronger technology.",
				"",
				"&c&lKey Rules of Phase 0:",
				"&8• &7Mekanism is strictly limited to &e1-slot basic machines&7 and early generators (&6Heat & Bio-Generator&7). Tier Installers, Wind/Solar, and Gas-Burning Generators are locked behind future phases!",
				"&8• &7AE2 &eME Controllers&7 are locked behind Phase 1B. You may only build &b8-channel Ad-Hoc networks&7.",
				"&8• &7Sidegrade OP weapons & armors (&cMekaSuit, Meka-Tool, Alloy Paxel, IF Infinity, IAF & Cataclysm weapons&7) are completely removed! Armors from &6Ice and Fire&7 and &cCataclysm&7 can be crafted, but have &e0 stats&7—serving purely as visual trophies for &dCosmetic Armor Reworked&7!",
				"",
				"&aClick the checkmark to begin your industrial awakening!"
			],
			x: 0.0, y: 0.0,
